    {
      "id": "en:summary",
      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "summary",
      "text": "Tryndamere lets out an insulting cry, decreasing surrounding champions' Attack Damage. Enemies with their backs turned to Tryndamere also have their Move Speed reduced.",
      "variant": null
    },
    {
      "id": "en:body",
      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Tryndamere hurls insults, reducing champions' Attack Damage by 20/35/50/65/80 for 4 seconds and Slowing by 30/35/40/45/50% while cowering from him for 3.25 seconds.",
      "variant": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ko:summary",
      "locale": "ko_KR",
      "tier": "summary",
      "text": "트린다미어가 모욕적인 외침으로 주변 챔피언들의 공격력을 낮춥니다. 트린다미어에게서 등을 돌린 챔피언들은 이동 속도 역시 느려집니다.",
      "variant": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ko:body",
      "locale": "ko_KR",
